{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "pricing-coefficient-2026-09-21",
    "name": "服务信息与影响系数（wk-customer-pricing）",
    "description": "服务信息与影响系数 27 个接口的 Postman 集合，与《docs/api/pricing-coefficient/pricing-coefficient.md》同步维护。\n\n**使用说明**\n\n1. 先在集合 Variables 中按环境修改 `baseUrl`（默认 `http://localhost:8031`）；\n2. 鉴权已统一预置：集合级 Authorization 头直接携带裸 token（无 Bearer 前缀），取变量 `{{token}}`，全部请求自动继承；token 过期时替换 `token` 变量即可；\n3. 每个请求已内置测试脚本：断言 HTTP 200 且 `code=00000000`；\n4. 建议顺序：\n   - 后台：pricing-param list/get/update → service-location list/list-by-level/detail/tree-preview/add/update/delete → urgency-level list/detail/add/update/delete → lead-time-coefficient list/detail/add/update/delete/hit → location-coefficient list/detail/add/update/delete；\n   - 前台：service-info tree/urgency-levels/pricing-coefficient compose。\n\n业务规则速记：D16/R-30 保底价 = 综合费率 × min_billable_hours；R-41/Q-9 影响系数 = max(紧急K, 地点K, 时间K)；IN-PC-08 lead_time 区间不重叠+全覆盖 [0,∞)；BR-PC-06b urgency 首项不可改名/删。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "Authorization", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8031" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paramId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "locationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "urgencyCode", "value": "" },
    { "key": "leadTimeId", "value": "" }
  ],
